---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Code of Conduct"
  description="How GU NeuroSoc members are expected to behave, summarised from the SRC Clubs and Societies Code of Conduct, with links to the full text."
>
  <article class="container-site section">
    <h1 class="headline text-h1 font-black">Code of Conduct</h1>
    <div class="prose-site mt-8">
      <p>
        GU NeuroSoc follows the SRC Clubs and Societies Code of Conduct. In plain English, it asks
        everyone to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>treat everyone with respect;</li>
        <li>promote equality, diversity and inclusion;</li>
        <li>not discriminate against, harass or bully anyone;</li>
        <li>act in line with the society's aims, values and best interests;</li>
        <li>not bring the society into disrepute;</li>
        <li>comply with SRC and University policies.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The University's Code of Student Conduct applies at every society event, on or off campus.
      </p>
      <p>This is a summary. The full SRC text is what applies.</p>
      <h2>Read the full Code</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.glasgowunisrc.org/resources/neurosciencesociety/Code-of-Conduct/"
            >SRC Code of Conduct (society copy on the SRC website)</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.glasgowunisrc.org/pageassets/clubs-socs/start/SRC-Clubs-and-Societies-Code-of-Conduct-2026-27.pdf"
            >SRC Clubs and Societies Code of Conduct (PDF)</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To raise a concern, see <a href="/complaints">how to make a complaint</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
